{
    "id":  26789,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "Slim LED Circular Panel 30W 4CCT Select | OSRAM CHIP DURIS E 2835 | Cut-out 280mm",
    "reference":  "PLR30WOSR-3CCT-91872",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eDiscover our new range of \u003cstrong\u003eSlim LED Recessed Panels \u003c/strong\u003ewith \u003cstrong\u003eCCT\u003c/strong\u003e technology, the perfect solution for versatile, high-quality lighting. With colour options of \u003cstrong\u003e2700K, 3000K, 4000K and 5700K\u003c/strong\u003e, this \u003cstrong\u003e30W\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003ecircular downlight\u003c/strong\u003e equipped with \u003cstrong\u003eOSRAM DURIS E 2835\u003c/strong\u003e delivers exceptional brightness for any commercial environment.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIts modern design, 120º beam angle and \u003cstrong\u003eNO FLICK driver\u003c/strong\u003e guarantee uniform, flicker-free lighting with natural colours. Make your spaces stand out with this quality LED panel!\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eRecessed LED Circular Panel 30W | CCT | OSRAM\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eSlim LED Circular Panel 30W\u003c/strong\u003e features \u003cstrong\u003eselectable CCT\u003c/strong\u003e technology, allowing you to choose between \u003cstrong\u003e2700K, 3000K, 4000K and 5700K\u003c/strong\u003e to adapt the lighting to different environments and needs. Equipped with \u003cstrong\u003eOSRAM DURIS E 2835 chips\u003c/strong\u003e, it delivers uniform, efficient, high-quality lighting.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIts \u003cstrong\u003e120° beam angle\u003c/strong\u003e provides a wide light distribution, while the \u003cstrong\u003eNO FLICK Driver\u003c/strong\u003e eliminates flickering and improves visual comfort. It also offers a \u003cstrong\u003eCRI\u0026gt;85\u003c/strong\u003e for a more natural colour rendering.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIts \u003cstrong\u003eSlim, circular and modern\u003c/strong\u003e design makes it easy to integrate into different spaces, making it a versatile solution for residential, commercial and professional LED lighting projects.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMain features\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePower:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003e30W\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLED technology:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eOSRAM DURIS E 2835\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSelectable CCT:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003e2700K / 3000K / 4000K / 5700K\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBeam angle:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003e120°\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCRI:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003e\u0026gt;85\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDriver:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eNO FLICK\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFormat:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eCircular Slim\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInstallation:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eRecessed\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUses and applications\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eIdeal for \u003cstrong\u003ehomes, shops, shopping centres, hotels, restaurants and leisure centres\u003c/strong\u003e where efficient, uniform and adaptable LED lighting is required.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA \u003cstrong\u003eSlim LED lighting solution with OSRAM technology and CCT\u003c/strong\u003e, designed to offer versatility, visual comfort and a modern finish.\u003c/p\u003e",
